{
  "$comment": [
    "Per-pipeline R2D config for SafeFly V2. Everything here is stable identity;",
    "build numbers and descriptions are discovered at run time.",
    "",
    "abhReleaseId is the ABH release view's id. Do not read it off the browser URL:",
    "a service can hold several views over the same pipeline and the URL may carry",
    "whichever one was last opened. List them instead:",
    "  GET https://azurebuildhealthapi.azurefd.net/releaseIndex/<serviceTreeId>",
    "(token: az account get-access-token --resource 1b3d0fbc-ab49-4526-a4b4-18eaa1844d6e)",
    "",
    "ev2ServiceGroupFallback / regionsFallback are a LAST resort, not the normal",
    "path. A build parked at its Approval gate has not run its EV2 deploy task, so",
    "ABH cannot report a service group yet; the tool first borrows one from a",
    "previous build of the same pipeline (starting with the last SafeFly approved),",
    "and only then falls back here. Values here are trusted without verification,",
    "so they can drift; the tool warns when it uses them, and warns again when they",
    "disagree with what the builds report.",
    "",
    "leaseDisplayId is optional. When omitted, the tool finds approved leases",
    "covering the service and confirms with SafeFly's findCompatibleLease."
  ],
